<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Tanker Wars, 2017</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;USA&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&amp;nbsp;vs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Iran&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;20 April, 2017&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/STRONG&gt;Persian Gulf&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Playable Sides:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;USA&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;U&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Introduction:&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;FONT color=black&gt;In response to diplomatic tension regarding possible violations of a nuclear proliferation agreement, Iran has declared a quarantine on military traffic in the region. Our partner nations in the region have scaled back their operations and civilian traffic&amp;nbsp;has been complying&amp;nbsp;with instructions from the Iranian Navy. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal&gt;Your mission is to is to contest this state of affairs and demostrate the United States Navy's commiment to freedom of navigation in international waters.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;&lt;FONT color=red&gt;Scenario Design Notes:&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal&gt;This is a small Sea Control scenario representing a likely mix of forces and objectives; roughly equivalent to, but down scaled from,&amp;nbsp;Operation Praying Mantis during the Tanker Wars.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
